<title>CHINA: Morgan Stanley warrants on HSBC.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley warrants on HSBC.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) Ltd said it launched on Friday 21.8 million warrants on shares of HSBC Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$253.05	  PREMIUM	 17.2 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$2.9402	  GEARING	 8.2x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   04.JUN.98	  BOARD LOT     4,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$241.00	  SETTLEMENT    18.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG	  LISTING DATE  23.JUL.97</p>
<p>--NOTE:</p>
<p>EXERCISE FOR PHYSICAL SHARES AT ANY TIME FROM LISTING DATE TO MATURITY, OR IN CASH AT ISSUER'S OPTION.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441.</p>
</text>
